error BYN3219: `bogus` is not a mutation operator

  2 │     @unobservable(bogus) because "x is clamped by the caller"
    │                   ^^^^^ not an operator
    │
  help: use one of `boundary`, `relational`, `logical`, `condition`, `bool`, `arithmetic`,
        `literal`, `negation`, `statement`, `emptyReturn`, `variant`, or no argument for all
